tic examples"}]}],"id":"blk-8299","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8302","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-7594","text":"align terminology with "},{"id":"spn-7595","marks":["code"],"text":"SPEC.md"}]}],"id":"blk-8301","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8304","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-7596","text":"align contracts with "},{"id":"spn-7597","marks":["code"],"text":"contracts/v0.1.0/"}]}],"id":"blk-8303","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8306","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-7598","text":"align registry metadata with "},{"id":"spn-7599","marks":["code"],"text":"protocol/registry/v0.1.0/capabilities.registry.json"}]}],"id":"blk-8305","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8308","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-7600","text":"mention governance and provenance when they materially matter"}]}],"id":"blk-8307","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8310","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-7601","text":"prefer clarity over hype"}]}],"id":"blk-8309","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-8311","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-7602","text":"A simple rule of thumb:"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-8313","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-7603","text":"Write each page so that an engineer could understand what the capability is, how it composes, and how to implement or consume it without reading the whole repository first."}]}],"id":"blk-8312","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-8314","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-7604","text":"Short summary"}]},{"id":"blk-8315","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-7605","text":"This directory is the protocol’s "},{"id":"spn-7606","marks":["bold"],"text":"capability-level documentation surface"},{"id":"spn-7607","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-8316","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-7608","text":"The top-level spec explains the model. The schemas validate the artifacts. The contracts define typed behavior. The registry publishes discovery metadata."}